SUMMARY:The JLloyd Monday Mashup: w/sg Anne Coombs & Tyler Housholder!
DESCRIPTION:Kicking off August with Special guest Anne Coombs on guitar joining Duane Simpson for a 2 guitar night! Plus\, Tyler Housholder back on percussion!\nGet ready for a super funk-jazz acid-jazz dance night!\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nEvent starts at 8.Music starts at 8:30.Going until 11:15ish.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n$10. Thank you for the continued support!\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nMashup Mondays every Monday at One World Brewing West with special guests and different music every week!!\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nThe JLloyd MashUp explores different genres of music including Acid Jazz\, Funk\, Soul\, Afro Beat\, Reggae\, Break Beat\, and Latin. Led and curated by Jonathan Lloyd (The Fritz/Dubconscious/Cadillac Jones)\, the band is made up of some of Asheville’s busiest and hardest working musicians on the scene.
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/jloyd-mashup-mondays-w-sg/
